<p class="eyebrow eyebrow-warning">Request update</p>
<h1 class="heading">Access request update</h1>
<p class="greeting">Hi <%= recipientName %>,</p>
<p class="subheading">
  Thank you for your interest in Operix. Your recent access request cannot be completed at this time.
</p>

<table class="info-card warning-card" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
  <tr>
    <td>
      <p class="info-card-title">Request review complete</p>
      <p class="info-card-copy">
        No action is required from you right now.
      </p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div class="divider"></div>
<p class="quiet-note">
  Contact your organization administrator if you need assistance.
</p>
